/></text
><text color="#9643FC" creationdate="D:20250519080134+10'00'" flags="print,nozoom,norotate" inreplyto="6baf00c4-f988-408e-9196-035034f60833" date="D:20250519080134+10'00'" name="9a405e9d-826f-4cae-b19c-f08abe1090f1" icon="Comment" page="0" rect="69.333700,641.137000,93.333700,665.137000" subject="Sticky Note" title="Alexander Gibson"
><contents-richtext
><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:25.1.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"
><p dir="ltr"
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-14.0pt;text-align:left;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>Q14b: yes there was some practical reflections on the study</span
></p
></body
></contents-richtext
><popup flags="print,nozoom,norotate" open="no" page="0" rect="612.000000,573.137000,796.000000,665.137000"
/></text
><text color="#9643FC" creationdate="D:20250519080148+10'00'" flags="print,nozoom,norotate" inreplyto="6baf00c4-f988-408e-9196-035034f60833" date="D:20250519080148+10'00'" name="8827ee01-33fd-4c60-a331-1dbef89e93c5" icon="Comment" page="0" rect="69.333700,641.137000,93.333700,665.137000" subject="Sticky Note" title="Alexander Gibson"
><contents-richtext
><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:25.1.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"
><p dir="ltr"
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-14.0pt;text-align:left;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>Q14c: </span
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-13.3pt;text-align:left;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>However, a lot&#xD;more work needs to be done, and it is time for research groups&#xD;examining mental fatigue in sport science to go beyond the fundamental&#xD;angle and design research to understand this phenomenon&#xD;within the practical realm of sport performance. For example, while&#xD;some studies have already examined the role of different countermeasures&#xD;to combat mental fatigue, these studies did not attempt to&#xD;translate these results to the real world. Not only is it important that&#xD;valid measurement tools be further developed to quantify mental&#xD;fatigue in practical settings, but we also still need to understand the&#xD;exact nature and causes of this phenomenon outside of a laboratory&#xD;environment. Moreover, we must not forget that the performance of&#xD;all humans can be impacted by mental fatigue, which means that&#xD;every person employed in professions related to sport performance is&#xD;at risk. It is therefore important that coaches, clinicians, players, and&#xD;other relevant personnel be adequately informed on the nature of this&#xD;phenomenon and how to identify and counter it. IJSPP is a prime&#xD;vehicle to publish and communicate these efforts to the sporting&#xD;community.</span
></p
></body
></contents-richtext
><popup flags="print,nozoom,norotate" open="no" page="0" rect="612.000000,573.137000,796.000000,665.137000"
/></text
